  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESITCHAD: Reinforcement of Community Stability in the North of Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Territorial Development and Resilience Project in Chad (RESI-TCHAD) will invest in climate-resilient community infrastructure, identified by local communities themselves, to reduce vulnerabilities specific to the landlocked nature of targeted areas. The aim is to set up large-scale transformative investments in the key economic hubs of targeted towns in northern Chad, with a view to triggering structural transformation based on local potential and opportunities, and sustainably supporting socio-economic development and access to and quality of basic social services for communities, including refugees and migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
